# What never belongs in the repository.
#
# A package has no build output of its own -- `go get` compiles it in the
# consumer's build -- so most of this is what the tools and the editors leave
# behind.

# Test and coverage output.
*.test
*.out
coverage.*

# Local module resolution while something in the graph is not published.
go.work
go.work.sum

# Secrets. Nothing here reads one, and the rule stays so that the first file
# that does is not the one that finds out.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# What the editors and the operating systems leave behind.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
